                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَافِعٌ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفَعَةٌ</span></b>  A boy <i>grown up,</i> (Msb, TA,)
<i>grown tall;</i> (Ham, p. 354 et seq., Har, p. 189;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفَاعٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفَعٌ</span></b> . (Ham, ibid.) See an
ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبْأَةٌ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَادِخٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطَبِّخٌ</span>.

